  "Choose from the Bard list. You can replace one prepared spell when you gain a Bard level. Magical Secrets expands your choices starting at level 10.": {"id": "Pilih dari daftar spell Bard. Saat naik level Bard, kamu bisa ganti satu prepared spell. Magical Secrets menambah pilihan mulai level 10."},
