  "Choose from the Druid list for the spell levels you can cast. After a Long Rest, you can change any of those choices.": {"id": "Pilih spell Druid sesuai level spell yang bisa kamu cast. Setelah Long Rest, kamu bisa ubah pilihan itu."},
