  "Position before spending resources": {"id": "Ambil posisi dulu"},
  "Fix your armor first": {"id": "Cek armor dulu"},
  "Repeatable spell": {"id": "Spell yang bisa dipakai berulang"},
  "Spend a slot when it matters": {"id": "Simpan slot untuk momen penting"},
  "Help an ally recover": {"id": "Bantu teman pulih"},
  "Mind your Reaction": {"id": "Siapkan Reaction"},
  "Custom options": {"id": "Opsi custom"},
  "Describe what you do and ask the DM what to roll.": {"id": "Ceritakan apa yang kamu lakukan, lalu tanya DM perlu roll apa."},
  "Your Passive Perception is {value}. Offer to watch for danger when the party travels or takes a rest.": {"id": "Passive Perception kamu {value}. Coba ambil giliran mengawasi bahaya saat party bepergian atau rest."},
  "You are trained with {tools}. If you have the tool on hand, describe how you use it to solve the problem.": {"id": "Kamu punya Proficiency dengan {tools}. Kalau tool itu ada di tangan, jelaskan cara kamu memakainya untuk mengatasi masalah."},
  "Check {name} when an obstacle fits its effect. {description}": {"id": "Coba cek {name} kalau efeknya cocok dengan situasinya. {description}"},
  "Try {name} as a ritual when you have time. It does not need to be prepared and uses no spell slot.": {"id": "Kalau masih ada waktu, coba cast {name} sebagai ritual. Spell ini tidak perlu disiapkan dan tidak pakai slot."},
  "Your equipped armor imposes Disadvantage on Stealth checks. If someone must scout ahead, let a quieter ally lead.": {"id": "Armor kamu memberi Disadvantage pada Stealth Check. Kalau perlu pengintai, biarkan teman yang lebih senyap maju dulu."},
  "Use {name} when closing is unsafe. Your Attack Roll modifier is {bonus}.": {"id": "Pakai {name} kalau mendekat terlalu berisiko. Modifier Attack Roll kamu {bonus}."},
  "You can make {count} attacks when you take the Attack action on your turn.": {"id": "Saat pakai Attack Action di giliranmu, kamu bisa menyerang {count} kali."},
  "You have {ac} AC, {hp} maximum HP, and {speed} Speed. Use cover or distance when enemies can reach you before your next turn.": {"id": "Kamu punya AC {ac}, HP maksimum {hp}, dan Speed {speed}. Cari Cover atau jaga jarak kalau musuh bisa menjangkaumu sebelum giliran berikutnya."},
  "Your equipped armor is untrained. You cannot cast spells while wearing it and have Disadvantage on Strength and Dexterity D20 Tests.": {"id": "Kamu belum punya Training untuk armor ini. Selama dipakai, kamu tidak bisa cast spell dan punya Disadvantage pada D20 Test Strength dan Dexterity."},
  "Keep only one Concentration effect active at a time.": {"id": "Pertahankan satu efek Concentration saja dalam satu waktu."},
  "Keep {name} in mind if an ally falls to 0 HP. Check whether you can reach them in time.": {"id": "Siapkan {name} kalau ada teman jatuh ke 0 HP. Cek apakah dia masih dalam jangkauan."},
  "Consider saving your Reaction for {name} when its trigger applies.": {"id": "Pertimbangkan menyimpan Reaction untuk {name} saat syaratnya terpenuhi."},
  "Check your table’s ruling before relying on a custom effect. Your manual notes come first.": {"id": "Cek keputusan meja sebelum mengandalkan efek custom. Pakai catatan manual sebagai acuan."},
  "This attack has Disadvantage.": {"id": "Serangan ini punya Disadvantage."},
  "Tray shows {count} of these rolls.": {"id": "Nampan menampilkan {count} hasil roll."},
  "When a fight merits a use of Rage, start it with a Bonus Action, close with the enemy, and attack with Strength.": {"id": "Kalau pertarungannya layak pakai Rage, aktifkan dengan Bonus Action, dekati lawan, lalu serang dengan Strength."},
  "Before rolling, decide who needs Bardic Inspiration most. Give it with a Bonus Action when the ally is in range, then use your Action on a spell or attack.": {"id": "Tentukan siapa yang perlu Bardic Inspiration. Beri dengan Bonus Action kalau dia dalam jangkauan. Lalu pakai Action untuk cast spell atau menyerang."},
  "Decide early whether the encounter calls for a control or protection spell. Keep healing available for an ally who falls to 0 HP.": {"id": "Putuskan sejak awal apakah encounter ini butuh spell control atau perlindungan. Sisakan healing kalau teman jatuh ke 0 HP."},
  "Look for a spell that controls a choke point. Decide whether Wild Shape solves the scene better than staying able to cast spells.": {"id": "Cari spell yang bisa mengunci jalur sempit. Pertimbangkan Wild Shape kalau bentuk baru membantu lebih banyak daripada tetap bisa cast spell."},
  "Pick a weapon for the target and terrain. If you have Action Surge, save it for a turn when another Action can change the fight.": {"id": "Pilih senjata yang cocok buat target dan medan. Kalau punya Action Surge, simpan untuk giliran saat satu Action tambahan bisa mengubah situasi."},
  "Use movement to choose a target and an exit. When you need the Bonus Action for defense or movement, plan around that before committing.": {"id": "Gunakan mobilitas untuk memilih target dan jalur keluar. Kalau butuh Bonus Action untuk bertahan atau bergerak, rencanakan sebelum maju."},
  "Stay close to the allies you protect. If you have Divine Smite and meet its trigger, weigh spending the spell slot and Bonus Action after a hit.": {"id": "Tetap dekat dengan teman yang kamu lindungi. Kalau punya Divine Smite dan pemicunya terpenuhi, pertimbangkan pakai Spell Slot dan Bonus Action setelah serangan kena."},
  "Start from a position with a clear shot or a safe route into melee. Use Hunter’s Mark if the target is likely to survive long enough to justify Concentration.": {"id": "Mulai dari posisi dengan tembakan bebas atau jalur aman ke melee. Pakai Hunter’s Mark kalau targetnya akan bertahan cukup lama untuk sepadan dengan Concentration."},
  "Choose a Finesse or Ranged weapon. Try to get Advantage, or attack an enemy with a qualifying ally beside it and without Disadvantage, to enable Sneak Attack.": {"id": "Pilih senjata Finesse atau Ranged. Cari Advantage, atau serang target yang bersebelahan dengan sekutu yang memenuhi syarat tanpa Disadvantage, supaya Sneak Attack berlaku."},
  "Choose the right spell and targets first. If you have Metamagic, spend points when it materially improves the outcome.": {"id": "Pilih spell dan target dulu. Kalau punya Metamagic, pakai poin saat hasilnya benar-benar lebih berguna."},
  "Use a reliable cantrip or a trained weapon when a Pact Magic slot would add little. Plan a Short Rest with the party if one fits the situation.": {"id": "Pakai cantrip andalan atau senjata yang kamu kuasai kalau Pact Magic Slot belum perlu. Ajak party Short Rest kalau situasinya aman."},
  "Use a prepared spell when it changes the battlefield. For routine turns, preserve slots with a cantrip and position yourself to protect Concentration.": {"id": "Pakai prepared spell saat bisa mengubah keadaan. Untuk giliran biasa, pakai cantrip dan ambil posisi yang membantu menjaga Concentration."},
