  "Species describes your character’s ancestry. It gives you traits such as senses, movement, or special abilities.": {"id": "Species menunjukkan asal-usul karaktermu. Ini bisa memberi trait seperti indra, cara bergerak, atau kemampuan khusus."},
  "A Dwarf can see in darkness within the range of their Darkvision.": {"id": "Dwarf bisa melihat dalam gelap sejauh jangkauan Darkvision-nya."},
  "A Dragonborn can use a Breath Weapon whose damage type comes from their ancestry.": {"id": "Dragonborn bisa memakai Breath Weapon. Tipe damage-nya mengikuti garis keturunannya."},
  "Background describes what you did before adventuring. It gives you an Origin feat, skill and tool proficiencies, and starting gear or money. It also sets which ability scores you can increase.": {"id": "Background menceritakan kegiatanmu sebelum jadi petualang. Kamu dapat Origin Feat, Skill dan Tool Proficiency, serta perlengkapan atau uang awal. Background juga menentukan Ability Score mana yang bisa kamu naikkan."},
  "A Sage gains proficiency in Arcana and History.": {"id": "Sage mendapat Proficiency di Arcana dan History."},
  "A Soldier gains Savage Attacker, an Origin feat that can improve a weapon damage roll.": {"id": "Soldier mendapat Savage Attacker, Origin Feat yang bisa membantu hasil damage roll senjata."},
  "Proficiency means you add your Proficiency Bonus when you make a roll covered by that training. At level 1, that bonus is +2.": {"id": "Proficiency berarti kamu menambahkan Proficiency Bonus ke roll yang sesuai dengan latihanmu. Di level 1, bonusnya +2."},
  "If you have Athletics proficiency, add +2 to a level 1 Athletics check to climb a difficult wall, in addition to your Strength modifier.": {"id": "Kalau kamu punya Proficiency di Athletics, tambahkan +2 ke Athletics Check level 1 saat memanjat tembok yang sulit, selain modifier Strength."},
  "If you have proficiency with a Longsword, add +2 to a level 1 attack roll with it. The bonus is for the attack roll.": {"id": "Kalau kamu punya Proficiency dengan Longsword, tambahkan +2 ke Attack Roll pakai senjata itu di level 1."},
  "Name, starting level, and ancestry traits.": {"id": "Nama, level awal, dan trait dari Species."},
  "Class & features": {"id": "Class & fiturnya"},
  "Class, subclass, and the abilities they grant.": {"id": "Class, Subclass, dan kemampuan yang kamu dapat."},
